.TH DUB-ADD 1 "2026-08-16" "The D Language Foundation" "The D Language Foundation"
.SH "نام (NAME)"
dub-add \- Adds dependencies to the package file.
.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
\fBdub add \fR<\fIpackage\fR>[@<\fIversion-spec\fR>] [<\fIpackages...\fR>] \fIOPTIONS\&.\&.\&.\fR
.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
Adds <packages> as dependencies.



Running "dub add <package>" is the same as adding <package> to the "dependencies" section in dub.json/dub.sdl.

If no version is specified for one of the packages, dub will query the registry for the latest version.
.SH "گزینه‌ها (OPTIONS)"
.SS COMMON OPTIONS
See \fBdub\fR(1)
.SH "وضعیت خروج (EXIT STATUS)"
.TP
.BR 0
DUB succeeded
.TP
.BR 1
usage errors, unknown command line flags
.TP
.BR 2
package not found, package failed to load, miscellaneous error
.SH "فایل‌ها (FILES)"
\fIdub\&.sdl\fR, \fIdub\&.json\fR
.SH "نویسنده (AUTHOR)"
Copyright (c) 1999-2026 by The D Language Foundation
.SH ONLINE DOCUMENTATION
.URhttp://code.dlang.org/docs/commandline
http://code.dlang.org/docs/commandline
.UE
.SH "همچنین ببینید (SEE ALSO)"
\fBdub\fR(1), \fBdub-convert\fR(1), \fBdub-fetch\fR(1), \fBdub-init\fR(1)
